  "releaseNotes": "Adds one-record-per-request traffic logging on ASP.NET Core HTTP Logging, isolated post-Build UseX(Action<TOptions>) option overrides with reload and validation support, and shared NetLib IP normalization in client-network features. Updates Eigenverft.NetLib.Infrastructure to 1.0.20264.61091 and uses the neutral Eigenverft package icon. Existing flood protection, self-HTTP warmup, isolated static/PWA hosting, canonical redirects, typed request features, Kestrel/SNI, and Data Protection helpers remain included.",
